.jpg", "height": 360, "width": 480, "preference": -7, "id": "34", "resolution": "480x360"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/_uNejvElFOw/hqdefault.webp", "preference": -6, "id": "35"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_uNejvElFOw/sddefault.jpg", "height": 480, "width": 640, "preference": -5, "id": "36", "resolution": "640x480"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/_uNejvElFOw/sddefault.webp", "preference": -4, "id": "37"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_uNejvElFOw/sddefault.jpg", "description": "Nafakhum Falls in Bandarban | নাফাখুম ঝরনা বান্দরবান .\nNafa-khum Waterfall (Bengali: নাফাখুম) is located in Thanchi Upazila of Bandarban on the Sangu River. It is among the largest waterfalls in the country by volume of water falling. The wild hilly river Sangu suddenly falls down here about 25–30 feet.\n\nThe falls are located in a remote area three hours’ walking distance from Remakri, Thanchi Upazila, Bandarban District. Remakri is located three hours by boat on the Sangu River from Tindu, which is itself three hours by boat from Thanchi. Nafa-khum is not very popular as a tourist destination.\n\nThe word “Khum” in Marma language means “Waterfall”. A special type of flying fish, whose local name is nating, is found at the bottom in a small cave as they swim against the stream but cannot jump over the height of the fall.\n\nNafa-khum (Bengali: নাফাখুম) is a waterfall in Bangladesh on the Sangu River. It is among the largest waterfalls in the country by volume of water falling.[1] The wild hilly river Sangu suddenly falls down here about 25–30 feet.\n\nA Journey to Nafakhum \nThe word \"Khum\" in Marma language means \"Waterfall\". A special type of flying fish, whose local name is nating, is found at the bottom in a small cave as they swim against the stream but cannot jump over the height of the fall.\n\nNafa-khum Falls, Bandarban, Bangladesh \nNafakhum waterfall - Most beautiful place in Bangladesh \nOn the way to Nafakhum \nBandarban : Thanchi : Remakkri to Nafakhum : \nJourney to extreme Nafakhum Waterfall (নাফাখুম জলপ্রপাত )\nNafakhum - বাংলাদেশের নায়েগ্রা\nWonderful rocky way near Nafakhum", "channel_id": "UCTML85sPsFPo_Tw-_JNjJkA", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTML85sPsFPo_Tw-_JNjJkA", "duration": 229, "view_count": 1251, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_uNejvElFOw", "categories": ["Travel & Events"], "tags": ["Nafakhum", "Bandarban", "Bangladesh", "নাফাখুম জলপ্রপাত", "Nafakum Waterfall", "S A Developers", "Nafakhum Waterfall", "Journey to Nafakhum Falls", "Beautiful Bangladesh", "way near Nafakhum"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "comment_count": 7, "like_count": 8, "channel": "ESkill IT", "channel_follower_count": 2550, "uploader": "ESkill IT", "uploader_id": "@ESkillIT", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@ESkillIT", "upload_date": "20170531", "timestamp": 1496249767, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Youtube", "display_id": "_uNejvElFOw", "fulltitle": "Nafakhum | Nafakhum Bandarban | Nafakum Waterfall | Bandarban | Way To Nafakhum", "duration_string": "3:49", "is_live": false, "was_live": false, "epoch": 1781109096, "asr": 44100, "format_id": "18", "format_note": "360p", "source_preference": -1, "fps": 30, "audio_channels": 2, "height": 360, "quality": 6.0, "has_drm": false, "tbr": 718.558, "filesize_approx": 20607884, "width": 640, "language_preference": -1, "ext": "mp4", "vcodec": "avc1.42001E", "acodec": "mp4a.40.2", "dynamic_range": "SDR", "url": "https://rr4---sn-vg5obxcq-jb2z.googlevideo.com/videoplayback?expire=1781130700&ei=bJEparj7J_Da9fwPl_e0qQI&ip=122.152.50.174&id=o-APFdfRC9xSbNqeY_6gjYUXSc9SZkDiiTTzImqor4MKCM&itag=18&source=youtube&